msgid "Outside collaborators"
msgstr "外部协作者"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/set-up-single-sign-on-saml.rst:132
msgid ""
"You can still add outside collaborators that don't use SAML and manage their"
" access. There are two ways to manage this access:"
msgstr "你仍可添加不使用 SAML 的外部协作者并管理其访问权限。有两种管理方式："

