"requiring a login."
msgstr "使用 :doc:`共享 </commercial/sharing>` 提供需要登录的短期访问权限。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/set-up-single-sign-on-saml.rst:139
msgid "Revoke user's access to all the projects"
msgstr "撤销用户对所有项目的访问权限"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/set-up-single-sign-on-saml.rst:141
msgid ""
"By disabling access to the SAML integration to a user, you revoke access to "
"all the projects their linked Read the Docs user had access to, and disable "
"login on Read the Docs completely for that user."
msgstr ""
"禁用某用户对 SAML 集成的访问权限，即撤销其关联的 Read the Docs 用户对所有可访问项目的权限，并完全禁用该用户在 Read the "
"Docs 上的登录。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/set-up-single-sign-on-saml.rst:147
msgid ""
"If the user signed up to Read the Docs previously to enabling SAML on your "
"organization, they may still have access to their account and projects if "
"they were manually added to a team."
msgstr "若该用户在你组织启用 SAML 之前就注册了 Read the Docs，且曾被手动添加到某个团队，他们可能仍能访问自己的账户和项目。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/set-up-single-sign-on-saml.rst:150
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/set-up-single-sign-on-saml.rst:158
msgid ""
"To completely revoke access to a user, remove them from all the teams they "
"are part of."
msgstr "要完全撤销某用户的访问权限，请将其从所有所属团队中移除。"

