msgid ""
"If the user was already signed in to Read the Docs when their access was "
"revoked, they may still have access to documentation pages until their "
"session expires. This is three days for the dashboard and documentation "
"pages."
msgstr "若用户在访问权限被撤销时已登录 Read the Docs，他们可能仍能访问文档页面，直至会话过期。仪表盘和文档页面的会话有效期为三天。"

